SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Esmæ
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, June 12th\n\nEvening D
 ance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nDJ
  Esmæ \\| Facilitator TBA\n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the DJ (Facilitator 
 Pathway)\nDJ Esmæ (Megan Belling) has been moving in the world of ecstati
 c dance for over 13 years and sharing musical journeys as a DJ for the pas
 t 5. Her sets weave sound into pathways of remembrance\, honoring the unfo
 lding of one’s own becoming. She invites an awakening of expression and 
 emotion that may have been resting beneath the surface. Through tension\, 
 rhythm\, and texture\, she holds space for dancers to return to themselves
 .\nListen to her mixes at: [https://soundcloud.com/djesmae](https://soundc
 loud.com/djesmae?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e223_tv4_tp1&fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTA
 AYnJpZBExUEw3a0M1OVdXaXZBT2RYVnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4gg
 bnEohOZ94TUnWPAicVHteJYL-Vbl-dWeYQnw59RnToTclK5Q1ESMI_QPQ_aem_4hciEUoMe8CE
 Wfa0kdm6iQ)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Wa
 rm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late w
 ill be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure containe
 r. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned a
 way for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n[https://ashevill
 emovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../](https://ashevillemovementcollect
 ive.org/.../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10
